  "captions": {
    "tiktok": "Stop bringing Ophelia. Bring Louisa from Schiller's Love and Intrigue instead. Found in Ghost Light. The voice is AI. #monologue #audition #actorslife #actortok #theatrekid",
    "youtube_title": "Stop bringing Ophelia. #shorts",
    "youtube_description": "Five actors in the lobby, all whispering O, what a noble mind. So Milo typed what he needed into Ghost Light: a poor girl in love with a nobleman, under a minute.\nUp came Louisa, from Friedrich Schiller's Love and Intrigue. 59 seconds, heartbroken like Ophelia, and almost nobody brings her. Free on the App Store. Built by a working actor. The voice is AI.\n#monologue #audition #actorslife #acting",
    "instagram": "Stop bringing Ophelia.\n\nHow many Ophelias has the panel heard today? Milo counted five in the lobby alone.\n\nSo he described what he needed in Ghost Light: a poor girl in love with a nobleman, under a minute. Up came Louisa, from Schiller's Love and Intrigue. 59 seconds, heartbroken like Ophelia, and almost nobody brings her.\n\nFree on the App Store, built by a working actor. Link in bio. The voice is AI.\n\n#monologue #audition #actorslife #actorsofinstagram #actortraining"
  },
